Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:21.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙海盗哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单单是没看到什么兵器的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能！但事实就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.83,0:01:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概有人先我们一步拿走了\N也只有这种可能性吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也只能这么想了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样？现在再争斗也没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.11,0:01:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要将这些平分吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:47.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五五分帐足够做你的嫁装了\N这能让你轻松选婿，找个好男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了，珊德拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也差不多厌倦这种血腥的生活了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.25,0:01:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就选这一个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.65,0:02:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也太不为自己着想了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:03.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟只要一个怪蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错，这个看起来像怪蛋的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是火星古代史的传说秘宝最终兵器！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第十二话 恐怖的最终兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:12.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛋变成剑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:25.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太大意了，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不知道所寻找的最终兵器是什么样子的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.86,0:03:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确是有点用功不足
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.89,0:03:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这也是没有办法的事！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是银河大学联考也不会出这题啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:42.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这次有点麻烦了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别…别走过来！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.82,0:03:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的喜欢恶感很强烈的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该去重看火星古代史的第三章
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于终极兵器和棺木的事里面可是写的很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.69,0:03:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也得等你活着离开才可以！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧！哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.92,0:04:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉向着金字塔上面逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次是向下，而且速度奇快
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停住了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真想不到最终兵器竟然是那个最不起的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:52.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听见没有啊，瑞蒂？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.69,0:05:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是哥普拉听到吗？瑞蒂？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接收得很好 我听得到，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我查查火星古代史第三章
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧急事态
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说那里有关于最终兵器的记载
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ok
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好快点，瑞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在可是被那怪物追着跑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有相关的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我开玩笑了，瑞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海龟号的资料库应该很齐全的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全银河的影像资料 印刷资料全都有输入进去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.19,0:06:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能没有火星古代史
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实有火星古代史
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.49,0:06:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是第三章却没有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火星古代史被发现时 第三章就已经被撕走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:08.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:11.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是珊德拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.39,0:07:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她变成了巨人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:46.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉 我给你一个到地府的告别礼好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火星古代史第三章中最终兵器的秘密就在你的脚底
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？原来在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:56.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你！珊德拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.39,0:07:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是宅心仁厚的好女人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是身型对我来说是有点巨大而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.19,0:08:37.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下最终兵器就是我一个人的东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:57.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，请回答！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.19,0:08:58.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是海龟号！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:08:59.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，请回答！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:03.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:04.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:06.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定还活着！一定！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.66,0:09:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海龟号在燃烧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:09:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有错！是珊德拉队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:21.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊德拉队长！恭喜你！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于得到最终兵器了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:29.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对！我得到了全宇宙最终强的最终兵器！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定会得到基尔顿的最高评价
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.39,0:10:34.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上连络地球总部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:37.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有必要去联络他们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.19,0:10:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是上头命令得到最终兵器后\N要马上连络基尔顿本部的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基尔顿算什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦我手上有最终兵器 基尔顿根本不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的我才是全宇宙的帝皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:21.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:33.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:43.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借我点我火吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.82,0:11:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自动灭火系统失灵了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了，瑞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你连这点小状况也处理不了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:11:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别急！别急！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的海龟号可是很耐热的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算跳近太阳也可以支撑两小时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.85,0:12:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好烫，好烫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有自动的还有手动的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:48.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着，我亲眼在金字塔顶看见火星古代史第三章\N现在就将那记忆投射到屏幕上面去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你解读了，瑞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.95,0:12:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK？哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了，现在看看我的记忆的正确性到底如何吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,设定完成了 请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ok
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:14.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是火星二千年左右的古代文字
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:25.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火星古代史第三章
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终兵器是懂得进化的兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进化？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.02,0:13:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别急，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:35.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照顺序来解读
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雪哥利亚的队长珊德拉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:50.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是基尔顿特殊部队代表桑德 杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.15,0:13:55.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是奉本部之命来取回最终兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请马上交给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊德拉小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死部下一事我可以不追究
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:09.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是全宇宙的最强王者
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:14.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那把剑变成了镭射枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:37.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最大能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部雷射炮瞄准她的眉间！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.95,0:14:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.85,0:14:49.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退避！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:15.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西北方发生炮击
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是珊德拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.65,0:15:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信古星古代史第三章上所说的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么说我都照自己方式来做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么那东西就交给珊德拉吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂，我是哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.55,0:15:40.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人的战车还真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那里的情况怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下就是补充燃料之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然过热有点不稳定 应该还是可以启动的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK，万事拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火星古代史第三章
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终兵器是懂进化的兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.65,0:16:09.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到更强的武器 就会进化出凌驾其上的无敌力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到利剑就会变成更锋利的剑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里了，多明尼克！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:17.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.65,0:16:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也即是说最终兵器就是会模仿亲眼见到的武器\N然后进化出起越它的能力 是能不断成长的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ok!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，开始潜下去 多明尼克！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:07.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧！最终兵器！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要超越那架战车的能力！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.52,0:17:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快看！多明尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.98,0:17:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此！看了战车后又进化了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克，别放开我的手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去重新启动海龟号！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海龟号能动了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:37.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂用C模式！潜入砂里！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.65,0:19:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深度200米
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:04.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人向南面地面接近
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被发现了，敌人逐渐逼近
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只眼在砂中视线还可以这么强
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管了，继续潜下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.52,0:19:20.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它看到有潜砂能力的兵器\N就要有凌驾其上的能力吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去这件武器不断进化
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成无敌的最终兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:30.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第三章中这么记载着
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.35,0:19:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有最终阶段最终兵器的人甚至可以毁灭整个宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:41.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是底下海！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果宇宙中人还希望活下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终兵器必须被毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:58.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是金字塔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了，瑞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让海龟号飞起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样不行，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:12.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到海龟号飞行的话，它也会有飞行的能力的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是重点了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐请让坐！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着胜负就在10秒间决定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:23.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,10秒？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:34.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在它进化成战车时我就计过了 \N它的进化过程须要10秒钟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之一切包在我身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.22,0:20:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于肯飞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.82,0:20:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终兵器你也能飞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要超越海龟号的能力！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.25,0:21:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.05,0:21:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,2！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然转向掉头了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,4！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,5！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.45,0:21:09.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,6！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.65,0:21:10.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,7！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:12.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,8！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,9！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.65,0:21:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,10！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:21:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:21:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎样处理它？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.78,0:22:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我蛋白你要蛋黄吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.18,0:22:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢你这样的傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:09.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不喜欢蛋白！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就此决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.38,0:22:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望世上有只永远孵不出来的蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.97,0:22:44.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,运输中的金块连运输船一起被偷了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.71,0:22:47.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用说这一定是基尔顿干的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.31,0:22:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我和瑞蒂潜入拉斯维加斯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:53.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实是我手开始痒想赌上一把
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.61,0:22:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是在这里除了要对付经理外
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.42,0:22:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要应付一只可爱的麻烦精
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是忙得一蹋糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.82,0:23:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一集\N 死亡的轮盘中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.29,0:23:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
